	(text_box "Read it as roles: the cloud holds Galaxy and Pub/Sub; the site holds the StarWatch clients and the hardware. Violet arrows are data reported up, orange arrows are control or commands sent down."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 253 0)
		(size 270 10.21)
		(margins 1.8175 1.8175 1.8175 1.8175)
		(stroke
